<h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; color: #000000;">Verify your email</h1>

<p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Hi <%= @name %>,</p>

<p style="margin-bottom: 32px; color: #4B5563;">
    Welcome to ProxySock! We're excited to have you on board. 
    Please verify your email address to get started with your account.
    This link will expire in <strong>30 minutes</strong>.
</p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
    <a href="<%= @confirmation_url %>" class="btn">Verify Email Address</a>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6B7280; margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding-top: 24px;">
    If you didn't create an account with us, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>
